sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Proposer as Jira consumer
    participant Cassini
    participant Receiver as Git observer
    participant Processor as Scheduler processor
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Creds as Credentials agent

    Note over Admin,Receiver: Admission rules first, signed and delivered like configuration
    Admin->>Processor: signed admission spec for observe-repo
    Processor-)Cassini: admission spec
    Cassini-)Receiver: admission spec
    Receiver->>Receiver: verify for itself, until then accept nothing

    Note over Proposer,Graph: A proposal
    Proposer-)Cassini: Proposal kind, subject, evidence
    Cassini-)Processor: Proposal, publisher named by the broker
    Processor->>Graph: write a Proposal node
    Cassini-)Receiver: Proposal, publisher named by the broker
    Receiver->>Receiver: normalise, then apply the rules in order
    alt rejected
        Receiver-)Cassini: ProposalDecision rejected and the rule
    else pending
        Receiver-)Cassini: ProposalDecision pending and what for
    else accepted
        Receiver->>Creds: RetrieveSecret for the bound name
        Creds-->>Receiver: re-encrypted to the agent's certificate
        Receiver->>Receiver: add the repository to its set
        Receiver-)Cassini: ProposalDecision accepted
    end
    Cassini-)Processor: ProposalDecision
    Processor->>Graph: write a decision node, linked to the proposal

    Note over Admin,Receiver: Approval and credentials are edits to the signed rules
    Admin->>Processor: a new signed admission spec
    Processor-)Cassini: admission spec
    Cassini-)Receiver: admission spec
    Receiver->>Receiver: re-evaluate every pending proposal

    Note over Processor,Receiver: A restarted receiver gets them again
    Processor-)Cassini: replay the kind's proposals
    Cassini-)Receiver: Proposal
    Receiver->>Receiver: re-evaluate against the current rules
